/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  cyclohexane -- case-local PARTIAL overlay of the standard record: the Fuller
  diffusion volume, which the catalogue record does not carry.
  `overlayOf cyclohexane;` declares this a DELTA: everything else (critical
  constants, vapour pressure, heat capacities, liquid viscosity, ...) is the
  catalogue's.  This file used to be a full copy of an older import snapshot
  of the record plus this one value (DEV.md 4c C421: one home per fact).

  Source of the value: Fuller: 6 C x 15.9 + 12 H x 2.31 (Poling, Prausnitz & O'Connell 5ed Table 11-1, p. 11.11; no ring increment -- the table gives one for aromatic and heterocyclic rings only).  Added by the case (C329).
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
overlayOf cyclohexane;
variationReason "adds diffusionVolume 122.9 (Fuller), which the catalogue record cyclohexane does not carry: Fuller: 6 C x 15.9 + 12 H x 2.31 (Poling, Prausnitz & O'Connell 5ed Table 11-1, p. 11.11; no ring increment -- the table gives one for aromatic and heterocyclic rings only).  Added by the case (C329).";

diffusionVolume 122.9;
